+## Sales
+
+Schema 3 adds a sales array, initially empty for existing stores. Each sale
+line records its ticket, UTC sale instant, dish, portion count and scaled
+ingredient quantities at import time. These quantities preserve historical
+theoretical use if a recipe changes. Consumption movements use the sale
+instant and reference `sale:<ticket>`.
